{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_qbswoz3zluscoowk45lq4gx4su6rlgbs6cv326oadux7tltfyerq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01NnN5sEt1dsJs7nFC1ZgiAm","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"mkdir -p $TMPDIR/asmtest/src && cd $TMPDIR/asmtest && printf '[package]\\nname=\"asmtest\"\\nversion=\"0.1.0\"\\nedition=\"2021\"\\n[lib]\\ncrate-type=[\"cdylib\"]\\n[workspace]\\n' > Cargo.toml && cat > src/lib.rs <<'EOF'\nuse std::arch::global_asm;\n\nglobal_asm!(\n    \".section .data.cptest,\\\"aw\\\",@progbits\",\n    \".balign 32\",\n    \".globl zz_table\",\n    \".type zz_table,@object\",\n    \".size zz_table,4\",\n    \"zz_table:\",\n    \".byte 1,2,3,4\",\n    \".globl zz_other\",\n    \".type zz_other,@object\",\n    \".size zz_other,4\",\n    \"zz_other:\",\n    \".byte 9,9,9,9\",\n);\n\nunsafe extern \"C\" {\n    static mut zz_table: [u8; 4];\n    static mut zz_other: [u8; 4];\n}\n\n#[unsafe(no_mangle)]\npub unsafe extern \"C\" fn zz_sum() -> i32 {\n    let a = (&raw const zz_table) as *const u8;\n    let b = (&raw const zz_other) as *const u8;\n    let mut s = 0i32;\n    for i in 0..4 { s += *a.add(i) as i32; s += *b.add(i) as i32; }\n    s + (b as i32 - a as i32)\n}\nEOF\ntimeout 300 cargo build --offline --release 2>&1 | tail -5; nm -D --defined-only target/release/libasmtest.so | sort","description":"Test global_asm data symbol export from cdylib"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2829,"cache_read_input_tokens":241088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2829,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a7ff890e-034c-49fc-82fa-f29dc73173cc","uuid":"9dca794c-f719-419b-8598-e5bcd452d2af","timestamp":"2026-08-27T08:16:46.360Z"}
